    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client requirements for an intelligent assistance tool, we can leverage we expertise in Large Language Models (LLMs) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned to provide accurate and relevant answers. we can utilize we experience with LoRA and QLoRA fine-tuning methods to adapt Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, to the client's specific domain and tone. we RAG capabilities can be employed to facilitate access to information by integrating with existing systems of information, such as business software, civil status, town planning, and electronic management of documents. we can use we vector stores experience, including Qdrant, Weaviate, pgvector, and FAISS, to efficiently store and retrieve relevant information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve the quality of answers, we can implement we explainability and transparency methods, such as source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME. implement will enable the intelligent assistance tool to provide clear explanations for the intelligent assistance tool recommendations or proposals." ;
