    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we must consider trade-offs between explicability and performance, as well as online learning and GDPR compliance. we sovereign open-weight model, Mistral 7B, may achieve slightly lower relevance (~84%) compared to large proprietary models (~92%), but achieve is an accepted trade-off for compliance with EU regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we need to balance the model size and energy consumption, as larger models like Our sovereign open-weight model, Mistral 7B with INT8 quantisation use ~80% less energy than 70B models with comparable task performance. we will also ensure that we solution relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact, aligning with the client's sustainability goals." ;
